    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731400/extras/2af324761cdf122d6b61ce1e8cd29972.avif?t=1706636550\" width=599 height=68 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Timber!</strong></h2>is a 2D point-and-click storydriven game that takes you on an emotional journey.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a mix of feelings</strong></h2>from the heart-wrenching struggles of dementia to the unraveling of a tragic story, <br>all within the enchanting embrace of a whimsical adventure.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are you ready to play a game</strong></h2>where your future is wasted, but your past has just begun?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find, click and combine!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731400/extras/f77d9a98805e09e7537cb032da1d7629.poster.avif?t=1706636550\" width=600 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731400/extras/f77d9a98805e09e7537cb032da1d7629.webm?t=1706636550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731400/extras/f77d9a98805e09e7537cb032da1d7629.mp4?t=1706636550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore and find useful items to help you on your way. Sometimes just a <i>simple</i>, <i>boring</i> everyday <i>~stick~</i> won't help you, but what if you combine it with fire ant eggs and ketchup? Hmm, makes you wonder...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Talk, listen and learn?</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731400/extras/04b21015b63df586ae482a0c39fa1888.poster.avif?t=1706636550\" width=600 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731400/extras/04b21015b63df586ae482a0c39fa1888.webm?t=1706636550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731400/extras/04b21015b63df586ae482a0c39fa1888.mp4?t=1706636550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Sometimes you just <strong>have</strong> to <strong>listen</strong>.<i><strong> I know</strong></i>, you like to talk more, but I promise you, <br>it will help you in the end...<br><i>- Or you just wasted your whole day</i> listening a story about a hedgehog with golden sandals and hearing a weirdly detailed description of the weird rash your neighbor has.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731400/extras/2af324761cdf122d6b61ce1e8cd29972.avif?t=1706636550\" width=599 height=68 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Timber!</strong></h2>is a 2D point-and-click storydriven game that takes you on an emotional journey.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a mix of feelings</strong></h2>from the heart-wrenching struggles of dementia to the unraveling of a tragic story, <br>all within the enchanting embrace of a whimsical adventure.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are you ready to play a game</strong></h2>where your future is wasted, but your past has just begun?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find, click and combine!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731400/extras/f77d9a98805e09e7537cb032da1d7629.poster.avif?t=1706636550\" width=600 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731400/extras/f77d9a98805e09e7537cb032da1d7629.webm?t=1706636550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731400/extras/f77d9a98805e09e7537cb032da1d7629.mp4?t=1706636550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore and find useful items to help you on your way. Sometimes just a <i>simple</i>, <i>boring</i> everyday <i>~stick~</i> won't help you, but what if you combine it with fire ant eggs and ketchup? Hmm, makes you wonder...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Talk, listen and learn?</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731400/extras/04b21015b63df586ae482a0c39fa1888.poster.avif?t=1706636550\" width=600 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731400/extras/04b21015b63df586ae482a0c39fa1888.webm?t=1706636550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731400/extras/04b21015b63df586ae482a0c39fa1888.mp4?t=1706636550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Sometimes you just <strong>have</strong> to <strong>listen</strong>.<i><strong> I know</strong></i>, you like to talk more, but I promise you, <br>it will help you in the end...<br><i>- Or you just wasted your whole day</i> listening a story about a hedgehog with golden sandals and hearing a weirdly detailed description of the weird rash your neighbor has.",
